      "en": "“‘None of you shall approach any close relatives, to uncover their nakedness: I am the LORD.",
      "ko": "너희는 골육지친을 가까이하여 그 하체를 범치 말라 나는 여호와니라",
      "source_text_hash": "131d8ad18b4a6ae34346342920dc164b6d01e79fb13486927e67b9fbb452e90a",
      "translation_text_hash": "038e21bca1711957180b754f5d57453a4a8ca4e1b8e6ebacda1021d498028d4f",
